!case-studies/heritage-aerial/data/**
!case-studies/mcp-ies-rag-demo/data/
!case-studies/mcp-ies-rag-demo/data/**
!case-studies/modip-plastics-kg/data/
!case-studies/modip-plastics-kg/data/**
